ension-normalized, componentwise singular Hodge polynomials are invariant under the equivalence generated by polynomial left–right changes and genuine identity extensions. The nonzero constant term excludes representatives of dimension below five in this equivalence class."}]],"$Ld"]}],"$Le","$Lf","$undefined","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13"]}]]}]]}],"$L14"]
